<title>UK: Sitcars sets $83 million April 2002 FRN.</title>
<headline>Sitcars sets $83 million April 2002 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SITCARS FUNDING LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  MBIA(AAA/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT    $83 MLN	 BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    23.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +18 BP    PAY DATE  S-14.MAY.97</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES  40 BP     AVG LIFE    1.5 YRS</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC   25 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	INDIRECTLY SECURED BY THAI BHAT LOAN/LEASE</p>
<p>		RECEIVABLES.</p>
<p>	    **US/UK/HK/SING/JPN/CAYMAN</p>
